Description: Reusable R package and command-line agent for genomic peak
    annotation, pathway enrichment, and publication-ready figures using
    ChIPseeker, rGREAT, HOMER, clusterProfiler, Enrichr, DAVID,
    g:Profiler, WebGestaltR, ReactomePA, MSigDB, and Metascape-friendly
    exports.
